        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432800/extras/0ece62b3c722a3ffa0432df27615b63d.avif?t=1776233694\" width=780 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slingbot Survivors is a roguelite auto-shooter that blends bullet-heaven combat with physics-based platforming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a robot sent by humanity to an alien planet, tasked with wiping out its hostile wildlife. Armed with a grappling hook as your only means of movement, you will swing, zip, and launch yourself through chaotic battlefields while your arsenal automatically tears through waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432800/extras/d8353f03254846de5d7b6f07249eea82.poster.avif?t=1776233694\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432800/extras/d8353f03254846de5d7b6f07249eea82.webm?t=1776233694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432800/extras/d8353f03254846de5d7b6f07249eea82.mp4?t=1776233694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fresh take on the survivor-like formula, trading simple movement for fast, skill-driven traversal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432800/extras/b07098bdd5a0226a1970a18433a5ad91.avif?t=1776233694\" width=780 height=90 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Move Differently. </strong>Instead of walking, you navigate entirely with a grappling hook. Swing through levels, maintain momentum, and reposition constantly to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bullet-Heaven Combat. </strong>Face relentless hordes of alien enemies in auto-shooter gameplay inspired by the survivor-like genre. Focus on movement and positioning while your weapons handle the rest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Based Gameplay. </strong>Your movement and many weapons are driven by physics, creating more dynamic combat and allowing for expressive playstyles not seen in traditional survivor-likes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run-Based Progression. </strong>Each run lasts around 25 minutes and is filled with upgrades, weapons, and gadgets that shape your build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock and Experiment. </strong>Unlock new characters, weapons, and tools as you progress, expanding your options across runs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432800/extras/37c95a2b26c8ee16cd7fb9e71537febe.poster.avif?t=1776233694\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432800/extras/37c95a2b26c8ee16cd7fb9e71537febe.webm?t=1776233694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432800/extras/37c95a2b26c8ee16cd7fb9e71537febe.mp4?t=1776233694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why It Stands Out</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slingbot Survivors sits between slower-paced survivor-likes and more intense action roguelites, offering a higher skill ceiling through movement while keeping the accessibility of auto-shooter combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432800/extras/a4508bed66ee36978601af25783859f2.poster.avif?t=1776233694\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432800/extras/a4508bed66ee36978601af25783859f2.webm?t=1776233694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432800/extras/a4508bed66ee36978601af25783859f2.mp4?t=1776233694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Experience</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, energetic, and skill-driven gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A focus on precision movement and momentum</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short, replayable runs with meaningful progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lighthearted tone that does not take itself too seriously</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432800/extras/0ece62b3c722a3ffa0432df27615b63d.avif?t=1776233694\" width=780 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slingbot Survivors is a roguelite auto-shooter that blends bullet-heaven combat with physics-based platforming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a robot sent by humanity to an alien planet, tasked with wiping out its hostile wildlife. Armed with a grappling hook as your only means of movement, you will swing, zip, and launch yourself through chaotic battlefields while your arsenal automatically tears through waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432800/extras/d8353f03254846de5d7b6f07249eea82.poster.avif?t=1776233694\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432800/extras/d8353f03254846de5d7b6f07249eea82.webm?t=1776233694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432800/extras/d8353f03254846de5d7b6f07249eea82.mp4?t=1776233694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fresh take on the survivor-like formula, trading simple movement for fast, skill-driven traversal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432800/extras/b07098bdd5a0226a1970a18433a5ad91.avif?t=1776233694\" width=780 height=90 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Move Differently. </strong>Instead of walking, you navigate entirely with a grappling hook. Swing through levels, maintain momentum, and reposition constantly to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bullet-Heaven Combat. </strong>Face relentless hordes of alien enemies in auto-shooter gameplay inspired by the survivor-like genre. Focus on movement and positioning while your weapons handle the rest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Based Gameplay. </strong>Your movement and many weapons are driven by physics, creating more dynamic combat and allowing for expressive playstyles not seen in traditional survivor-likes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run-Based Progression. </strong>Each run lasts around 25 minutes and is filled with upgrades, weapons, and gadgets that shape your build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock and Experiment. </strong>Unlock new characters, weapons, and tools as you progress, expanding your options across runs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432800/extras/37c95a2b26c8ee16cd7fb9e71537febe.poster.avif?t=1776233694\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432800/extras/37c95a2b26c8ee16cd7fb9e71537febe.webm?t=1776233694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432800/extras/37c95a2b26c8ee16cd7fb9e71537febe.mp4?t=1776233694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why It Stands Out</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slingbot Survivors sits between slower-paced survivor-likes and more intense action roguelites, offering a higher skill ceiling through movement while keeping the accessibility of auto-shooter combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432800/extras/a4508bed66ee36978601af25783859f2.poster.avif?t=1776233694\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432800/extras/a4508bed66ee36978601af25783859f2.webm?t=1776233694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432800/extras/a4508bed66ee36978601af25783859f2.mp4?t=1776233694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Experience</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, energetic, and skill-driven gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A focus on precision movement and momentum</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short, replayable runs with meaningful progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lighthearted tone that does not take itself too seriously</p></li></ul>",
